  "question": {
    "text": "Let $u+v+w=3, u, v, w \\in \\mathbb{R}$ and $f(x)=u x^2+v x+w$ be such that $f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)+x y, \\forall x, y \\in \\mathbb{R}$. Then $f(1)$ is equal to",
